<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 60px',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    fontFamily: '"Arial", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>
        归因 · C1 / C2
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 10 }}>
        C1 与 C2——我们唯一能归因的两步
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}>
            两个比较都是对数损失的差值，对照 ±0.02 nats 的等价边际来读。
        </Text>

        <Image src="assets/fig04.png" style={{ width: 1140, height: 308, marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ width: 1140, padding: '18px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, marginTop: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                C1 付出 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>0.0055</span> nats，区间不含 0——
                差异真实，但远在边际之内。C2 换回{' '}
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>0.0015</span>，区间跨 0。阶梯的顶端并没有买到更好的预测。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>DSC5001 · 统计机器学习 I</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>第 32 组 · 4/10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
